    {
      "subId": "201704",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Thoma",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "20170403"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "20170403": {
            "id": "20170403",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, what brings you here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170404"
            ]
          },
          "20170404": {
            "id": "20170404",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Did you meet with the resistance? How's the battle going? Is it safe for me to come out yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170405"
            ]
          },
          "20170405": {
            "id": "20170405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Not just yet... We saw people patrolling on our way here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170406"
            ]
          },
          "20170406": {
            "id": "20170406",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "So it's still not over... I guess you came here because you have something to discuss?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170407"
            ]
          },
          "20170407": {
            "id": "20170407",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "I'll get someone to call for Miss Kamisato, bear with me for one second.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170408"
            ]
          },
          "20170408": {
            "id": "20170408",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen Text",
            "text": "You inform Ayaka and Thoma of the current situation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170409"
            ]
          },
          "20170409": {
            "id": "20170409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "I see. You have been through a lot since we last met.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170410"
            ]
          },
          "20170410": {
            "id": "20170410",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "I understand, you need evidence of the Tenryou Commission's betrayal. Let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170411"
            ]
          },
          "20170411": {
            "id": "20170411",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "Now that you mention it, there is one thing that has always concerned me. The Shogun's Army has been at war with the resistance for a long time now, but not once has the Shogun ever inquired about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170412"
            ]
          },
          "20170412": {
            "id": "20170412",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "I used to think that she simply didn't care, but looking at it now, perhaps the problem all along has been with the <color=#00E1FFFF>Tenryou Commission's reports</color> to the Shogun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170413"
            ]
          },
          "20170413": {
            "id": "20170413",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What do you mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170414"
            ]
          },
          "20170414": {
            "id": "20170414",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "The Tenryou Commission presides over domestic military affairs. If they ever had any intention of concealing information in their reports, we would have no way of knowing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170415"
            ]
          },
          "20170415": {
            "id": "20170415",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "Meanwhile, the Shogun would incorrectly conclude that the Vision Hunt Decree poses no threat, and would stick to her decision. If we had access to their reports, it would confirm everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170416"
            ]
          },
          "20170416": {
            "id": "20170416",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "But as I recall, the only person authorized to access that kind of official documentation is Kujou Takayuki.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170417"
            ]
          },
          "20170417": {
            "id": "20170417",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "It's heavily guarded too. Even with Sayu's help, swiping a document from under their noses is no easy task.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170418"
            ]
          },
          "20170418": {
            "id": "20170418",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "If only there was a way we could distract the guards just for long enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170419"
            ]
          },
          "20170419": {
            "id": "20170419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170422"
            ]
          },
          "20170422": {
            "id": "20170422",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Yoimiya's fireworks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170423"
            ]
          },
          "20170423": {
            "id": "20170423",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "That's a very Thoma-sounding suggestion...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170424"
            ]
          },
          "20170424": {
            "id": "20170424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "But it's a reasonable one. The Statue of the Omnipresent God is right by the Tenryou Commission. If someone set off fireworks near the statue, they certainly wouldn't ignore it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170425"
            ]
          },
          "20170425": {
            "id": "20170425",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "While they were preoccupied with that, Sayu could infiltrate the Tenryou Commission and take the report, as well as any other evidence she might find...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170426"
            ]
          },
          "20170426": {
            "id": "20170426",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Great! It feels like I'm getting closer and closer to being a free man again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170427"
            ]
          },
          "20170427": {
            "id": "20170427",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Ah... It feels like it's been an eternity since we last sat down and talked like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170428"
            ]
          },
          "20170428": {
            "id": "20170428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's not been quite that long...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170429"
            ]
          },
          "20170429": {
            "id": "20170429",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Well, it certainly felt like it to me... I've been looking forward to seeing you again every day since I got here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170430"
            ]
          },
          "20170430": {
            "id": "20170430",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "This teahouse used to be my favorite hiding place, but now... I've honestly lost track of how long it's been since I last set foot outside of here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170431"
            ]
          },
          "20170431": {
            "id": "20170431",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Oh, man! I want to go to the hot springs so badly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170432"
            ]
          },
          "20170432": {
            "id": "20170432",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Poor Thoma...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170433"
            ]
          },
          "20170433": {
            "id": "20170433",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "Let's focus on the issue at hand. The sooner the Vision Hunt Decree is abolished, the sooner Thoma will be free.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170434"
            ]
          },
          "20170434": {
            "id": "20170434",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "This was a reunion of sorts, but there's no time to catch up. We'll celebrate properly when it's all over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170435"
            ]
          },
          "20170435": {
            "id": "20170435",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Oh, let's play the hot pot game again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170436"
            ]
          },
          "20170436": {
            "id": "20170436",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're still thinking about that!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170437"
            ]
          },
          "20170437": {
            "id": "20170437",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "The Tenryou Commission is heavily guarded. Be careful when you get near. Let's meet back here afterwards.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20170438"
            ]
          },
          "20170438": {
            "id": "20170438",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Alright, {NICKNAME}. First, let's go to <color=#00E1FFFF>Hanamizaka</color> to find <color=#00E1FFFF>Yoimiya</color>."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "201710",
      "subQuestName": "Go and enlist Yoimiya's help",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "20171000"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "20171000": {
            "id": "20171000",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yoimiya, we need an extra-large firework! The super, duper big kind!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171001"
            ]
          },
          "20171001": {
            "id": "20171001",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Yoimiya",
            "text": "\"Extra-large firework\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171002"
            ]
          },
          "20171002": {
            "id": "20171002",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Yoimiya",
            "text": "Hee-hee, you sure came to the right person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171003"
            ]
          },
          "20171003": {
            "id": "20171003",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Yoimiya",
            "text": "As it happens, I made this really souped-up one just a couple days ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171004"
            ]
          },
          "20171004": {
            "id": "20171004",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Yoimiya",
            "text": "But it's so powerful that I haven't found anywhere I can test it out yet... may as well give it to you. Let me know how it turns out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171005"
            ]
          },
          "20171005": {
            "id": "20171005",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Yoimiya",
            "text": "Don't forget, move well away from it after you light the fuse, and try to avoid burning your clothes. Also, it's best that you cover your ears...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171006"
            ]
          },
          "20171006": {
            "id": "20171006",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, why does Paimon feel so nervous all of a sudden...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171007"
            ]
          },
          "20171007": {
            "id": "20171007",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Yoimiya",
            "text": "Hahaha, don't worry, it's just a firework, come on. What's the worst that could happen!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20171008"
            ]
          },
          "20171008": {
            "id": "20171008",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We'll give it a try... Thanks, Yoimiya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
